# Monorepo olie-fronts

Yarn 1 workspaces (`packages/*`). Apps: `management`, `cockpit`, `landing`. Lib: `@olie/ui`. Laravel backend in `../api-main`; Docker stack in `../docker-workspace`.

## Dependencies

```bash
yarn workspace @olie/<pkg> add|remove|upgrade <dep>
```

- Never `npm install` / `package-lock.json`
- Consumers pin `"@olie/ui": "1.0.0"` (no `^`); bump = update all consumers in the same PR
- Shared dependency versions (`vue`, `bootstrap`, `axios`, vuelidate…) must match between `ui` and consumers
- `resolutions.prosemirror-model` = `1.25.3` — do not remove without validating TipTap
- Changed `package.json` → commit root `yarn.lock`

## Dev

Prefer `cd ../docker-workspace && docker compose up` (Traefik `*.olie.localhost`). Isolated: Node 22 + `yarn workspace @olie/<pkg> dev`.

After changing `@olie/ui` / deps: `yarn clean && yarn install --frozen-lockfile`; restart front containers. `front-landing`/`front-cockpit` use an anonymous `node_modules` volume → may need `docker compose up -d --build`.

## Conventions

- Cross-app imports are forbidden → share via `@olie/ui`
- Prettier: 4 spaces, no `;`, single quotes (respect the package `.prettierrc`)
- CI: `yarn lint` on PR/`develop`. Deploy: push `master` → S3 + CloudFront
- No test suite in the monorepo
